    {
     "flag": "river_town_piazza_drained",
     "lines": [
      "Dry feet. Do you know how long it's been? Coffee's on the house. Once.",
      "The card tables are back. So are the arguments. Everything's normal."
     ]
    },
    {
     "lines": [
      "Coffee? Mind the water. Mind it more than that. There.",
      "Rubber boots and an espresso machine. Nobody trains you for this.",
      "I know everything that happens in this town. Usually before it happens."
     ]
    }
   ],
   "sleepy": [
    "Zzz… two coffees, one with grappa… no grappa before ten…"
   ],
   "topics": [
    {
     "id": "gossip",
     "label": "Any news?",
     "lines": [
      "Primo has told the 1953 story four times this week. It gets longer every time. He's now passing two champions.",
      "Gildo says the monster swam past my door during the flood. It was a log. I was looking.",
      "Ermes reads the gauge even when it's raining sideways. Especially then."
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "tickets",
     "label": "You sell train tickets?",
     "lines": [
      "The station has no ticket office since ninety-two. The railway asked the nearest bar. That's me.",
      "The valley train goes up into the mountains. When it goes. It's been a while."
     ]
    }
   ],
