    {
     "lines": [
      "Post! Nothing for you, but post. I stop for a coffee at every door, so it takes all morning. Thirty-one years, never lost a letter.",
      "The Signora Wanda got a postcard from her sister in Rimini. It says the sea is lovely. I'm only telling you because it was very short."
     ]
    }
   ],
